    "message": "Add two built-in germline dbs for human: _OGRDB.human.IGH+IGK+IGL.202605\nand _OGRDB.human.IGH+IGK+IGL.202605.src\n\nThese new germline dbs were obtained by importing the following\nAIRR-community/OGRDB germline sets for Human:\n- `IGH_VDJ`:     version 10 (released on 2026-05-27)\n- `IGKappa_VJ`:  version  5 (released on 2026-05-27)\n- `IGLambda_VJ`: version  4 (released on 2026-05-27)\n\nFor more information about these new germline sets, see:\n  https://wordpress.vdjbase.org/index.php/ogrdb_news/human-ig-sets-updated/\n",
    "time": 1780084408
  },
